From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:37:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 29/44] app-list: reload the taskbar ignore file on inotify
 instead of every 2 s

The App List re-read ~/.config/minimize-ws/ignore every 2 s whether or
not it had changed. It now watches the file's directory with inotify
(writes, renames and deletes of the file, and the directory being
created later) and reads the file only when it changed. Without inotify
it polls every 2 s and reads the file only when its modification time
changed. The 2 s check whether the taskbar runs stays: a taskbar that
crashed leaves its pid file behind, so no file event reports it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

